{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cfbeyc2Y5R46F2QovhyMj", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]` replays the commits that are in `<branch>` but not in `<upstream>` onto `<newbase>`. Plain `git rebase` forces the new base and the cut-off point to be the same thing. `--onto` lets you choose them separately.\n\n**Example:** you branched `feature` off `topic`, which was itself branched off `main`:\n\n```\nmain:    A---B---C\n              \\\ntopic:         D---E---F\n                        \\\nfeature:                 G---H\n```\n\nYou want `feature` to carry only G and H, based directly on `main`, without D, E and F:\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto main topic feature\n```\n\nResult:\n\n```\nmain:    A---B---C\n              |\\\n              | D---E---F      (topic, unchanged)\n               \\\nfeature:        G'--H'\n```\n\n- `main` is the new base the commits are placed on.\n- `topic` is the old base. Commits reachable from `feature` but not from `topic` (G and H) are the ones that get moved.\n- `feature` is the branch being rebased. If you leave it out, the current branch is used.\n\nG' and H' are new commits with new hashes, because their parent changed.\n\n**Common uses:**\n- Move a branch off another topic branch, as above.\n- Drop a range of commits: `git rebase --onto A B` removes the commits after `B` from the current branch's history, up to the tip, when you pass the commit just before the range as `B`. For example, `git rebase --onto HEAD~3 HEAD~1` removes the two commits before the tip.\n- Rebase after the upstream branch was squash-merged. This avoids replaying the old, already-merged commits."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7217, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16780, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7217}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "536fa9f8-e5fc-4916-8443-a7c017e81343", "uuid": "a511ae4d-31ed-4564-89d7-0997bec6da18", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T14:13:42.477Z", "request_id": "req_011CfbeybiB856bprck1RU4q"}
